{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n      \n        Scope Existing Plugin Collections by Product RECOMMENDED\n        Keep plugin infrastructure, add product ownership\n      \n    \n\n    \n      \n      \n        Data Model Changes\n        \n          // variantTypes collection — add product field\n          variantTypes {\n          label: \"Loại\"\n          name: \"loai\"\n          + product: → products // NEW! scopes to product\n          options: → join variantOptions\n          }\n          \n          // variantOptions — no change needed\n          // (already scoped via variantType)\n          \n          // variants — no change needed\n          // (already has product field)\n        \n      \n\n      \n      \n        \n          ✅ Pros\n          \n            Minimal changes to plugin structure\n            All existing relationships preserved\n            Cart/Order variant references still work\n            Plugin's variant hooks (validation, beforeChange) still work\n            Easy to filter: where: { product: { equals: productId } }\n          \n        \n        \n          ⚠️ Cons\n          \n            Need custom admin component for inline editing\n            Variant types/options still separate DB documents\n            Need cleanup hooks on product delete\n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    \n      How auto-generation works:\n      \n        Product beforeChange hook → when variantTypes/options change → CRUD variant types & options docs → compute cartesian product → create/delete variant docs","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1781628079445}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n      \n        Scope Existing Plugin Collections by Product RECOMMENDED\n        Keep plugin infrastructure, add product ownership\n      \n    \n\n    \n      \n      \n        Data Model Changes\n        \n          // variantTypes collection — add product field\n          variantTypes {\n          label: \"Loại\"\n          name: \"loai\"\n          + product: → products // NEW! scopes to product\n          options: → join variantOptions\n          }\n          \n          // variantOptions — no change needed\n          // (already scoped via variantType)\n          \n          // variants — no change needed\n          // (already has product field)\n        \n      \n\n      \n      \n        \n          ✅ Pros\n          \n            Minimal changes to plugin structure\n            All existing relationships preserved\n            Cart/Order variant references still work\n            Plugin's variant hooks (validation, beforeChange) still work\n            Easy to filter: where: { product: { equals: productId } }\n          \n        \n        \n          ⚠️ Cons\n          \n            Need custom admin component for inline editing\n            Variant types/options still separate DB documents\n            Need cleanup hooks on product delete\n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    \n      How auto-generation works:\n      \n        Product beforeChange hook → when variantTypes/options change → CRUD variant types & options docs → compute cartesian product → create/delete variant docs","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1781628081323}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n      \n        Scope Existing Plugin Collections by Product RECOMMENDED\n        Keep plugin infrastructure, add product ownership\n      \n    \n\n    \n      \n      \n        Data Model Changes\n        \n          // variantTypes collection — add product field\n          variantTypes {\n          label: \"Loại\"\n          name: \"loai\"\n          + product: → products // NEW! scopes to product\n          options: → join variantOptions\n          }\n          \n          // variantOptions — no change needed\n          // (already scoped via variantType)\n          \n          // variants — no change needed\n          // (already has product field)\n        \n      \n\n      \n      \n        \n          ✅ Pros\n          \n            Minimal changes to plugin structure\n            All existing relationships preserved\n            Cart/Order variant references still work\n            Plugin's variant hooks (validation, beforeChange) still work\n            Easy to filter: where: { product: { equals: productId } }\n          \n        \n        \n          ⚠️ Cons\n          \n            Need custom admin component for inline editing\n            Variant types/options still separate DB documents\n            Need cleanup hooks on product delete\n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    \n      How auto-generation works:\n      \n        Product beforeChange hook → when variantTypes/options change → CRUD variant types & options docs → compute cartesian product → create/delete variant docs","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1781628081564}
