{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"B\n      \n        Inline Types/Options + Keep Variants Collection NOW RECOMMENDED\n        Types & options as product arrays, variants stay separate for cart/order\n      \n    \n\n    \n      \n        Product Document\n        \n          product {\n          title, price, gallery, ...\n          enableVariants: checkbox\n          variantTypeDefs: array [\n          id: string (auto)\n          label: \"loại\"\n          options: array [\n          id: string (auto)\n          label: \"DAY - Có màu\"\n          ]\n          ]\n          }\n        \n        Gallery (updated)\n        \n          gallery: array [\n          image: → media\n          variantOptionId: text\n          // stores inline array item id\n          ]\n        \n        Variants (kept, modified)\n        \n          variant {\n          product: → products\n          options: json [{typeId, optionId}]\n          price, inventory, sku\n          }\n        \n      \n\n      \n        \n          ✅ Pros\n          \n            Natural fit — id+label is exactly what arrays give you\n            No orphan records — types/options deleted with product\n            Single document save for types/options\n            Variants still separate (queryable for inventory/cart/order)\n            Cart/Order → variant relationships preserved\n            Simpler admin UI — standard Payload array fields\n            Fewer API calls — no CRUD for type/option documents\n          \n        \n        \n          ⚠️ Changes needed\n          \n            Gallery: variantOption relationship → text field\n            Variant: options relationship → json/array field\n            VariantSelector component: read from product inline data\n            Plugin's VariantOptionsSelector: replaced by custom component\n            Override variant's validateOptions hook\n          \n        \n\n        \n          📊 Impact Summary\n          \n            Cart items → variant → still works (variant has id)\n            Order items → variant → still works\n            Gallery → option → minor change (relationship → text)\n            Frontend VariantSelector → reads from product\n            Delete variantTypes, variantOptions collections → clean up\n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    \n      Auto-generation flow:\n      \n        Product afterChange hook → read inline variantTypeDefs → compute cartesian product of all options → diff against existing variants → create missing / delete removed variant docs","choice":"b","id":null,"timestamp":1781628653424}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"B\n      \n        Inline Types/Options + Keep Variants Collection NOW RECOMMENDED\n        Types & options as product arrays, variants stay separate for cart/order\n      \n    \n\n    \n      \n        Product Document\n        \n          product {\n          title, price, gallery, ...\n          enableVariants: checkbox\n          variantTypeDefs: array [\n          id: string (auto)\n          label: \"loại\"\n          options: array [\n          id: string (auto)\n          label: \"DAY - Có màu\"\n          ]\n          ]\n          }\n        \n        Gallery (updated)\n        \n          gallery: array [\n          image: → media\n          variantOptionId: text\n          // stores inline array item id\n          ]\n        \n        Variants (kept, modified)\n        \n          variant {\n          product: → products\n          options: json [{typeId, optionId}]\n          price, inventory, sku\n          }\n        \n      \n\n      \n        \n          ✅ Pros\n          \n            Natural fit — id+label is exactly what arrays give you\n            No orphan records — types/options deleted with product\n            Single document save for types/options\n            Variants still separate (queryable for inventory/cart/order)\n            Cart/Order → variant relationships preserved\n            Simpler admin UI — standard Payload array fields\n            Fewer API calls — no CRUD for type/option documents\n          \n        \n        \n          ⚠️ Changes needed\n          \n            Gallery: variantOption relationship → text field\n            Variant: options relationship → json/array field\n            VariantSelector component: read from product inline data\n            Plugin's VariantOptionsSelector: replaced by custom component\n            Override variant's validateOptions hook\n          \n        \n\n        \n          📊 Impact Summary\n          \n            Cart items → variant → still works (variant has id)\n            Order items → variant → still works\n            Gallery → option → minor change (relationship → text)\n            Frontend VariantSelector → reads from product\n            Delete variantTypes, variantOptions collections → clean up\n          \n        \n      \n    \n\n    \n      Auto-generation flow:\n      \n        Product afterChange hook → read inline variantTypeDefs → compute cartesian product of all options → diff against existing variants → create missing / delete removed variant docs","choice":"b","id":null,"timestamp":1781628659055}
